: [{"content": "enpe7n4le03ob02re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Talking about classes and objects", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 10, "type": "DWS"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0, "correct": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "type": "EXT"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"coverimg": "enpe7n4le03ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "<strong>Nate:</strong> Hey, Susan! Why weren't you in class today? You missed some important information about Class-based programming.</br>\n<strong>Susan:</strong> Oh really? I thought we were studying that topic next week. What did I miss?</br>\n<strong>Nate:</strong> Well, first, we learned that class-based programming is a style of OOP where the classes of objects are the ones that give inheritance to other objects. This style of programming classifies each object in a class according to its features.</br>", "image": "enpe7n4le03ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 0}, {"time": "31000", "text": "<strong>Susan:</strong> Oh okay, that's easy to understand. I remember something about encapsulation, was it part of class-based programming?</br>\n<strong>Nate:</strong> Yes, it is a feature from class-based OOP. It prevents the users from breaking the invariants of a class. This is important because it focuses on grouping and packaging information instead of any security issues, and this allows you to change aspects of the implementation of an object's class without impacting the users' code.</br>", "image": "enpe7n4le03ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 1}, {"time": "65000", "text": "<strong>Susan:</strong> Hmm\u2026 I need more clarification on each feature. For example, inheritance. Did he explain anything about it?</br>\n<strong>Nate:</strong> Yes, inheritance is done by defining new classes as extensions of an already existing class. The first class is the parent class, and the new one is a child class. If the child class has only one parent class, it is single inheritance, but if it has more, it is multiple inheritance.</br>\n<strong>Susan:</strong> Can you organize classes into a hierarchy?</br>\n<strong>Nate:</strong> Yes, you can organize classes either in \"tree\", if it is single inheritance, or in \"lattice\", if it's multiple inheritance.", "image": "enpe7n4le03ob02re2img03.jpg", "id": 2}], "audiosrc": "enpe7n4le03ob02re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "title": "", "id": 5, "type": "audio"}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}]}